+Lens: with the six-axis lane capped at the count (blocks 32–33), the sphere lane's "torus memory time" is the exact target, isolated by the zero mode of the linearized field. Controls: block 26's sampler restated on tori (`supervisor_control_block34_torus_sim.py`) with an exponential fit of the ensemble mean of the projection — ratios scattered `0.5–1.9` (nonlinear) and `0.3–1.0` (the linear model's own) at `8–32` seeds, so rejected; the mean-squared angular displacement of the plane-average direction (`..._torus_msd.py`) adopted, calibrated by the linear model to `0.97–1.01`. Lens pass on the contract: exact sentences confined to the linearized field; the `1/|m|²` reading labelled executed; the bracket's looseness stated beside the executed asymptotic. Primary: T1 (modes; the multiplier identity symbolically), T2 (rational covariance recursions on `L = 2, 3, 4`), T3 (memory times enclosed; the bracket by exact lattice sums; the sine inequalities on an exact grid); runner 16 checks, 6 mutations. Refuting pass (`CHECKER_block34_findings.md`): nothing refuted on four items. Fold: "Machin" in the scan matched "Machine status"; dropped. Census 6/6 in-family.
+
+## block 34 — conformance gate (REVIEW_LOOP_PR_CONFORMANCE_SPEC sections 1-12, author pass, 2026-09-17)
+1 self-containment: PASS — inputs: this note, the axioms memo, block 01's note, all on `main` at `9a3ffc8d91`; block 26's law and linearization restated; blocks 13, 26 evidence addresses. 2 cache/execution: PASS. 3 claim-scope honesty: PASS — exact for the linearized field; the nonlinear comparison executed and unclaimed; the infinite plane untouched. 4 N-gate: PASS (N1–N8; N5 lines in the runner). 5–7: PASS. 8: run at the gates. 9–11: PASS. 12: run before the PR.
